            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this review the risk-benefit ratio of COX-2 inhibitors and NSAIDs is compared. In the discussion of the safety of these two groups different evaluation standards are used, which is not a basis of a rational pharmacotherapy.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
